//! 16x16 XBM bitmaps for the home tiles and the A/C mode picker.
//!
//! XBM rather than Flipper `.icon` assets: the manifest only compiles the one
//! app icon, and `canvas_draw_xbm` takes a plain byte array. One byte per 8
//! pixels, LSB is the leftmost pixel, two bytes per row.
//!
//! Regenerate with `tools/xbm.py` if you want to redraw one.

